  {
    "id": 33,
    "fullname": "What Works: Fast Field Scanning with AI",
    "displayname": "What Works: Fast Field Scanning with AI",
    "shortname": "Fast Field Scanning with AI",
    "courseimage": "https://course.innovate-us.org/pluginfile.php/3949/course/overviewfiles/DALL%C2%B7E%202024-05-22%2014.43.47%20-%20A%20simple%20abstract%20art%20piece%20with%20a%20color%20theme%20focusing%20on%20varying%20shades%20of%20blue%2C%20white%2C%20and%20incorporating%20a%20touch%20of%20teal.%20The%20composition%20should%20fe.jpeg",
    "categoryid": 5,
    "categoryname": "InnovateUS",
    "sortorder": 10004,
    "summary": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">According to <a href=\"https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/reading/nation/achievement/?grade=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The Nation’s Report Card</a>, only 33% of fourth graders were proficient readers in 2022. How can we improve that statistic? The number of people who die giving birth in America each year has <a href=\"https://everymothercounts.org/giving-birth-in-america/#:~:text=The%20number%20of%20women%20who,white%20women%20in%20the%20U.S.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">nearly doubled</a> in the last two decades. How do we reduce that number? The year 2023 was the <a href=\"https://www.climate.gov/news-features/featured-images/2023-was-warmest-year-modern-temperature-record#:~:text=Details,decade%20(2014%E2%80%932023).\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">warmest year on record</a>. How can we reverse that trend?</p><p><strong style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;\">What Works: Fast Field Scanning with AI</strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;\"> is designed to help public professionals accelerate the process of finding and implementing urgently-needed evidence-based solutions to public problems.</span><strong style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;\"> </strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The course teaches public professionals methods for researching, evaluating, and identifying what works and determining whether solutions that worked in one jurisdiction will work in their communities.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Comprising eight modules, the course equips learners with skills for getting smarter, faster from data from documents and people, while also providing hands-on advice for using Generative AI (GenAI) to improve the learning process.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Designed for busy professionals, the course will help you scan for the most effective policies, innovations, and interventions and build them with the communities you serve.  </p><p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-3d812ef8-7fff-cdc5-619d-2a7451401cc6\">This course is brought to you in partnership with <a href=\"https://results4america.org/\">Results for America</a> and <a href=\"https://www.solutionsjournalism.org/\">Solutions Journalism Network</a>.</strong></p><br /><p></p>",
