  {
    "id": 39,
    "fullname": "Using GenAI in Government",
    "displayname": "Using GenAI in Government",
    "shortname": "Using GenerativeAI in Government",
    "courseimage": "https://course.innovate-us.org/pluginfile.php/8846/course/overviewfiles/claudio0060_A_sophisticated_and_abstract_graphic_design._A_gr_727180be-ef2a-446e-9a82-2e9ca2694110_3-2.jpg",
    "categoryid": 8,
    "categoryname": "Responsible AI for Public Sector Professionals",
    "sortorder": 20002,
    "summary": "<div style=\"background-color:#fafafa;padding:2rem;\">\r\n<h3><strong>Welcome to the Using GenAI in Government Course!</strong></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\">Through hands-on activities, this course showcases the practical ways you can use Generative Artificial Intelligence (GenAI) in your work as a public professional.</p>\r\n<p>You can navigate between the modules in the course by clicking the \"next activity\" or \"previous activity\" buttons which you will see at the top of each module.</p>\r\n<p>PLEASE NOTE: This is Part 1 of a 2-part Course. Once you complete these modules, please scroll down to find the link to Part 2 (Understanding Risks and Building Resilience) below.</p>\r\n<p>Have Questions? Contact us at hello@innovate-us.org!</p>\r\n</div>",
