    "summary": "<div style=\"background-color:#fafafa;padding:2rem;\">\r\n    <h3>Welcome!</h3>\r\n    <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-667a4e1a-7fff-da59-4555-daa924e559da\">This course delves into policy, projects, and societal impact. We'll cover data governance issues, how to design your own AI projects, and broader societal challenges like copyright implications and potential misuses. For those interested, we'll also provide guidance on developing AI governance policies.</span><br /></p>\r\n    <p>Once you have completed all the modules, come back to this page to claim your certificate!</p>\r\n    <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>Have any questions or need assistance? Write to us at hello@innovate-us.org!</span></p>\r\n</div>",
