  {
    "id": 46,
    "fullname": "Designing Democratic Engagement with AI: Practical Strategies for Public Participation",
    "displayname": "Designing Democratic Engagement with AI: Practical Strategies for Public Participation",
    "shortname": "Designing Democratic Engagement with AI",
    "courseimage": "https://course.innovate-us.org/pluginfile.php/61901/course/overviewfiles/democratic-engagement-course.png",
    "categoryid": 5,
    "categoryname": "InnovateUS",
    "sortorder": 10008,
    "summary": "<div style=\"background-color:#fafafa;padding:2rem;\">\r\n<h3>Welcome!</h3>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-667a4e1a-7fff-da59-4555-daa924e559da\">This course provides public sector professionals with a practical understanding of community engagement and its role in improving public service delivery. Through hands-on activities and best practices, participants learn to design and run engagement as a powerful tool for connecting with the communities they serve. The course covers the fundamentals of engagement, practical approaches across contexts, methods for consultation, deliberation, and co-creation, and strategies for genuinely listening to communities. By the end of the course, participants will be equipped to plan and deliver engagement effectively and confidently in their public sector roles.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\">Have any questions or need assistance? Write to us at hello@innovate-us.org!</p>\r\n</div>",
